Feature: The event log names each tool error's kind and each malformed call's class
  A standalone session's tool.result event gains "error_kind" for a tool error (a well-formed
  call whose tool failed) and "malformed_class" for a malformed call (an unknown or disabled
  tool name, or arguments the tool rejects), each from a fixed vocabulary and never the error
  text or the call's arguments. Every other result carries neither field. tool.call events,
  the existing tool.result fields and everything the model receives stay as they are.

